            <sparkle:version>66</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.33</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.33

- Reworked Kiki's interface around a consistent compact spacing, typography, surface, and control system.
- Fixed Learning table rows and selection highlights so text stays vertically centered at every window size.
- Made correction scope default to the app where Kiki observed an app-specific edit.
- Tightened Voice Studio, navigation, buttons, tables, history, dictionary, and speaker editing for a calmer native Mac layout.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.33/Kiki-0.6.33-macOS.zip" length="53808874" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="/IE47iXCvEaebz+N6ZSEftSKlFF+8br5PFvAGBazb4iCo1g7dNrc2E3NW6LSl6aM8xdsGgZQsC3cuZ1zNaEzDw=="/>
